{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Mystery Boxes are drop crates released by ",["l","齐先生","Mr. Qi"],". After spending 50 days in the valley or after collecting the second ",["l","兑奖券","Prize Ticket"]," from the billboard, the player will see a cutscene with ",["l","齐先生","Mr. Qi"]," and will be informed by a pop up that Mystery Boxes can now be found. Afterwards, they can be obtained in a variety of ways. After opening more than 10 boxes, they can contain any item found in ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"es (other than ",["l","金色动物饼干","Golden Animal Cracker"],"s or ",["l","自动抚摸机","Auto-Petter"],"s)."]],["p",["Mystery Boxes can be cracked by ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," in the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith shop"]," for 25g, similar to ",["l","矿物#Geodes","Geode"],"s. However, unlike Geodes, they cannot be broken open using a ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"],"."]]]],["Locations",2,[["p",["The following table lists the different actions that can spawn a Mystery Box if the player does not have ",["l","精通山洞#Masteries","Foraging Mastery"],"."]],["p",["The \"Chance\" column below indicates the probabilities that the game will attempt to spawn a Mystery Box. When such an attempt is made, the game performs a further check to see if it succeeds. If the player has ",["l","精通山洞#Masteries","Foraging Mastery"],", the check will fail (and will attempt to spawn a ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"]," instead). Otherwise, the probability of succeeding is 66% if the player does not have the power obtained from the ",["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"]," and 88% if they do."]],["p",["Also note that the chances of obtaining Mystery Boxes from some of the sources depends on and increases with higher daily ",["l","运气","luck"],", and in some cases, with ",["l","运气#Luck Buffs","Luck Buffs"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Activity"]},{"h":1,"v":["Chance"]}],[["Regular ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"]],["9-17% (dependent on daily luck)"]],[[["l","钓鱼#Golden Treasure Chests","Golden Fishing Treasure Chests"]],["12-21% (dependent on daily luck)"]],[[["l","淘盘","Panning"]],["5%"]],[["Shaking ",["l","树","trees"]," with seeds"],["3%"]],[[["l","怪物","Monsters"]],["0.01 + (Daily Luck / 10) + (Luck Buffs / 125)"]],[["Breaking containers in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],", ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", and ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]],["0.0081 + (Daily Luck / 15)"]],[["Chopping ",["l","树","trees"]," (Each Axe hit)"],["0.5%"]],[[["l","铁路#Trains","Present train cars"]," during ",["l","冬季","Winter"]],["2%"]]]],["p",["While train cars do have the same check for success as the other methods listed in the table, they will only ever drop Mystery Boxes."]],["p",["Many other ways to obtain Mystery Boxes, even after claiming ",["l","精通山洞#Masteries","Foraging Mastery"],", are listed below. These chances are not subject to additional checks for success."]],["l",0,[[1,["Purchasing from the ",["l","沙漠节#Calico Egg Merchant","Calico Egg Merchant"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],"."]],[1,["Reward from the ",["l","鳟鱼大赛","Trout Derby"]," and ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," festivals."]],[1,["Trading a ",["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"]," with the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"],"."]],[1,["Digging ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s (0-11.25% chance, depending on ",["l","运气#Daily Luck","Daily Luck"],")."]],[1,["Opening ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","treasure chests"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", if Foraging Mastery hasn't been claimed (3.6% chance, increased if Farming and/or Combat Mastery have not been claimed)."]],[1,["Opening ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"es or other Mystery Boxes."]],[1,["Completing ",["l","大树桩（地点）","Raccoon"]," requests beyond the fifth one."]],[1,["Completing the winter star Bundle."]],[1,["Using the ",["l","镇长的庄园#Prize Machine","prize machine"]," in the Mayor's Manor."]],[1,["If a player chops down a ",["l","农作物#Giant Crops","giant"]," ",["l","齐瓜","Qi Fruit"]," when the ",["l","任务#Qi's Crop","\"Qi's Crop\" quest"]," is not active, then they will receive one Mystery Box."]],[1,["If a player places any ",["l","牛奶","Milk"]," or ",["l","饼干","Cookie"],"s on a ",["l","家具#Tables","table"]," or ",["l","家具#Long Tables","long table"]," during the night of Winter 24th, then they will be exchanged for a Mystery Box."]]]]]],["Contents",2,[["p",["Below is a table of possible contents. All percent chances listed below are assuming that the player has already received at least one ",["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"],". If the player has not received their first ",["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"],", then the ",["l","星之书","Book Of Stars"]," cannot be obtained from Mystery Boxes, and the Book of Mysteries has an increased chance. See the ",["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"]," page for more details."]],["p",["All items marked with an asterisk (*) are only obtainable after the player has opened more than 10 Mystery Boxes and/or Golden Mystery Boxes. If the player has opened 10 or fewer boxes, then all items without asterisks have increased chances (ranging from +0.02% to +1.11%)."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Item"]},{"h":1,"v":["Chance"]}],[[["i","(O)279","Magic Rock Candy (1*)"]],["0.2%"]],[[["i","(O)74","Prismatic Shard (1*)"]],["0.4%"]],[[["i","(O)166","Treasure Chest (1*)"]],["0.8%"]],[[["i","(O)PurpleBook","Book Of Stars (1*)"]],["0.49%"]],[[["i","(O)Book_Mystery","Book of Mysteries (1*)"]],["0.49%"]],[[["i","(O)797","Pearl (1*)"]],["0.49%"]],[[["i","(O)373","Golden Pumpkin (1*)"]],["0.49%"]],[[["i","(H)MysteryHat","Mystery Hat (1*)"]],["0.97%"]],[[["i","(S)MysteryShirt","Mystery Shirt (1*)"]],["0.96%"]],[[["l","墙纸","Wallpaper (1*)"]],["0.95%"]],[[["i","(O)288","Mega Bomb (5*)"]],["0.63%"]],[[["i","(O)253","Triple Shot Espresso (3*)"]],["0.63%"]],[[["i","(O)687","Dressed Spinner (1*)"]],["0% (",["l","钓鱼#Fishing Skill","Fishing"]," Level < 6)\n0.16% (Fishing Level ≥ 6)"]],[[["i","(O)695","Cork Bobber (1*)"]],["0% (",["l","钓鱼#Fishing Skill","Fishing"]," Level < 6)\n0.16% (Fishing Level ≥ 6)"]],[[["i","(O)242","Dish O' The Sea (2*)"]]